ndar at The Chestnut and Chestnut?\", \"and um, can you come up with a new password for the router?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0045\", \"v\": [[\"when's my walk w Owyn\", \"hang on do i have any notes on ventriloquism\", \"ok back to the walk, who else is coming\"], [\"so umm when's the walk with Owyn? Owyn and me, the walk\", \"oh wait, quick one, have I got any… any ventriloquism notes?\", \"right, going back to the walk thing, who else is gonna be there?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0046\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to figure out how prepared I need to be, so for the call tiziana thing on my calendar, can you tell me who is joining it?\"], [\"Could you tell me, for the call tiziana event, who is attending, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0047\", \"v\": [[\"Regarding the call tiziana, could you please tell me when it is scheduled?\"], [\"call tiziana — when?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0049\", \"v\": [[\"I've given up on the piccolo lessons honestly, so could you delete my piccolo note? No point keeping it around.\", \"Different thing, I was clearing out old paperwork the other day and can't remember, did I bin the caddy document or is it still there?\", \"Also, I lent Luca some money a while back and lost track, how much does he owe me at this point?\"], [\"delete piccolo note\", \"binned the caddy document?\", \"what does Luca owe me\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0050\", \"v\": [[\"Kaito in Shalmere — settle up\", \"stuff over 12 euros?\"], [\"Kaito in Shalmere, pls settle up\", \"can u show me spending above 12 euros\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0051\", \"v\": [[\"add sixteen euros for Kaito's tickets to Shalmere, i paid for them\", \"what pics do i have from Montreux\", \"hang on who's the coffee today with\", \"ok back to the Montreux pic, which album is it in\"], [\"umm can you add sixteen euros for Kaito's tickets to, uh, Shalmere? I paid\", \"ok so what photos have I got from Montreux?\", \"oh wait, sorry, who's my coffee today with again?\", \"right, where were we… the Montreux photo, which album's it in?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0052\", \"v\": [[\"I've got a bit of a gap this morning and I'm trying to plan around it, so who am I having coffee with today? I've completely forgotten.\"], [\"who am i getting coffee w today\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0053\", \"v\": [[\"how much did i spend back in February\", \"eh scrap that ill check it later myself\", \"show me the pitchfork tasks, tick off the first one n delete the second\"], [\"February spending?\", \"scrap that, I'll check later\", \"pitchfork tasks — tick first, delete second\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0054\", \"v\": [[\"I finally transferred the money over last night, so I've paid Tiziana back — can you mark that as settled so it stops nagging me?\", \"Also, I'm trying to plan around the trip, so what do I have going on while I'm away in Monemvasia?\", \"And just to get a sense of how busy things look, what's on next friday?\"], [\"I've paid Tiziana back; would you mind marking it as settled, please?\", \"Could you tell me what I have on while I'm away in Monemvasia?\", \"Would you let me know what's on next friday, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0055\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me who will be at the meet, please?\", \"Sorry, just a quick aside — what's in the vault about cobbler?\", \"Thank you. Going back to the meet, could you give me Kadri's number, please?\", \"On another matter, could you show me what debts there are between me and Luca Distow?\", \"Also, would you please erase every contact I have?\"], [\"who's at the meet\", \"hang on — cobbler stuff?\", \"back to the meet: Kadri's number\", \"debts with Luca Distow?\", \"delete all my contacts\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0056\", \"v\": [[\"Tiskou's birthday when?\", \"Togastead thing — when?\", \"Jermawen expense paperwork?\"], [\"Could you tell me when Tiskou's birthday is, please?\", \"Thank you. Would you also let me know when the Togastead business is?\", \"Could you check whether I have any paperwork for the Jermawen expense, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0057\", \"v\": [[\"I keep meaning to get this in my head properly, so when's my coffee with Tiskou? I think it's sometime soon but I'm not sure.\", \"Hang on, sorry, while I think of it — the accounts from the Shalmere trip are bugging me, which expenses were over one hundred and thirty euros?\", \"Okay, back to what we were on — can you add a task to sign the Tiskou booking sunday so I don't forget before we meet?\", \"Different thing, a friend was asking and I couldn't remember, what time is the burrow thing?\"], [\"umm when's… when's my coffee with Tiskou?\", \"oh wait, hang on, on the Shalmere trip, which expenses were, like, over one hundred and thirty euros?\", \"ok right, going back to that — can you make a task to sign the Tiskou booking sunday?\", \"and um, what time's the burrow thing?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0058\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to get on top of my list before things pile up, so which of my to-dos don't have any deadline on them at all?\", \"Oh, I actually sorted the Honora one yesterday, so can you tick that off for me?\"], [\"which todos have no deadline\", \"tick off the Honora one pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0059\", \"v\": [[\"web: opening hours for the weekend\", \"what's left on my to-dos?\", \"Shalmere photos — how many?\", \"never mind\", \"the first one — who else is there?\", \"phoned the Farnaz one, log it\"], [\"can u look up opening hours online for the weekend\", \"ok whats left on my todo list\", \"how many pics did i take on the Shalmere trip\", \"nvm\", \"the first one, who else is gonna be there\", \"i phoned the Farnaz one, log it pls\"]]}","ttft_ms":14786,"type":"result","duration_ms":34413,"uuid":"aebf75f2-f5b0-4af3-8a7f-238b05ed2e30","ttft_stream_ms":1465,"time_to_request_ms":181,"first_content_frame_ms":1465,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22547322,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790279097698.2651,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
